        "native_id": "CVE-2026-113704"
      },
      "title": "a2aproject a2a-rs Push Notification push_notification_sender.rs HttpPushSender server-side request forgery",
      "summary": "A vulnerability has been found in a2aproject a2a-rs up to 0.4.3. This affects the function HttpPushSender of the file crates/server/src/push_notification_sender.rs of the component Push Notification Handler. Such manipulation of the argument TaskPushNotificationConfig leads to server-side request forgery. The attack may be launched remotely. The name of the patch is 2ba50176ea9f222d9a7d0f0e8cfe6fae7cf4c224. Applying a patch is advised to resolve this issue.",
      "raw_text": null,
      "published_at": "2026-10-20T22:00:25.887000Z",
      "updated_at": "2026-10-22T02:30:51.655440Z",
